76	     * running from the first to the last day of its month and named yyyy-mm. A month whose name is
77	     * already a period, or whose days overlap a period on the sheet, is left out; the others are
78	     * still made. Refused (400) when the to-date is before the from-date.
79	     */
80	    @Transactional
